265	     * a second traversal); {@code polar} is the weighted average of the children's own {@code
266	     * polar} vectors, weighted by each child's own stiffness (how high-impedance-dominant that
267	     * child is, derived from its retained {@link Branch#blendCoefficient} and quantized to
